+### `src/cd_config_note.rs` / `src/config.rs` — Day 230 (07:14): `/cd` back into the launch directory no longer calls its own `.yoyo.toml` "NOT applied" (#1032)
+
+**Cause.** `cd_config_note` read `<target>/.yoyo.toml` and never compared it with the file `load_config_file` actually loaded. `LOADED_CONFIG_PATH` records `.yoyo.toml` as a **relative** path, so after a `/cd` it cannot be resolved against the current dir. `record_loaded_config_path` now also stores `LOADED_CONFIG_RESOLVED` (canonicalized while the cwd is still the launch dir, falling back to `cwd.join`), read through `config::loaded_config_resolved_path()`. `LOADED_CONFIG_PATH` and `loaded_config_is_project_local` are unchanged.
