+**Fix.** Pure `is_loaded_config(target, loaded)` canonicalizes both paths (symlinks and `..` spellings match). It returns `false` if nothing was loaded or either canonicalization fails, so a failure falls back to the old warning, never to silence. `reading_for_note(reading, is_loaded)` drops only the NOT-applied section list. Deny entries (still reported as applied) and `Unreadable` stay as they were. `print_cd_config_note` applies both before choosing the text and the volume. `dispatch.rs` is untouched. Also covers `/cd ~` when `~/.yoyo.toml` was the loaded file.
